msgctxt "388"
msgid "Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting."
msgstr "Scusa se ti ho fatto aspettare."

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Oh... I wanted you to come here by yourself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "This was supposed to be a date, you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "I'll wait here for you, so please, could you come back by yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"There you are, Kiryu-san! I was so worried about you! You were so late, I "
"thought you might have gotten into an accident or something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "My bad..."
msgstr "Colpa mia..."

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Well, you can make it up to me... by having a good time with me today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Oh, sure... You got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "568"
msgid "You see that guy at that table over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "He's been staring at me for a while..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Maybe I'm just imagining things, but I think I've seen him before..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Where do you think you know him from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "...Never mind, forget it. Let's just go, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "688"
msgid "By the way, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "There's something I wanted to ask you about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Remember that weird guy I pointed out on our last date? I found out my "
"father sent him to spy on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "My mom told me about it when I called home the other day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Dad's in Okinawa right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"He said he wasn't going to force me to come home, but he said I needed to "
"give him a good reason for why I'm staying out here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "What did you tell him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Well... I told him I'm staying here because I'm in love."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I have a huge favor to ask you! Could you pretend to be my "
"boyfriend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Just for a day! Pretend to be my boyfriend when I go to meet with my dad? "
"Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "...All right."
msgstr "...Va bene."

